  "content": "\n\n<h1>更好的鍛造台</h1>\n<p>我不喜歡新的鍛造介面，所以我製作了一個模組來讓它看起來好一點。</p>\n<h3>原版</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jjblock21/BetterSmithingTable/7ed02276c535ca587ab2425c5a91f5231f5f899c/images/before-with-items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>安裝模組後</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/jjblock21/BetterSmithingTable/blob/7ed02276c535ca587ab2425c5a91f5231f5f899c/images/after-with-items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"\"></p>",
